# Project One RC — Design Freeze

Authority: RC-001, RC-002, RC-003, RC-004, RC-005, RC-006, RC-007, RC-008, RC-009, CDS-001.

## Scope

RC work must improve **consistency and stability** without redefining approved governance architecture (GPA-001, GPA-002, GDS-001, GRFC-001).

## Allowed

- Shared primitives (`Button`), lifecycle tokens, focus/disabled/loading states
- Pilot migration on Governance Hub, Cockpit, Matter cards, lifecycle timelines
- Replacing duplicated inline button/badge styles on those surfaces

## Not allowed without GRFC

- New major pages, navigation models, governance workflows, lifecycle stages
- Database migrations, API/RLS/permission changes
- Global rewrites outside the pilot surfaces listed in RC-001

## Button rules

- One primary action per compact UI area
- Use `src/components/ui/Button.tsx` — do not add a third-party UI library
- Lifecycle stage actions use `lifecycleOutlineButtonClass` or `lifecyclePillClassName`
- CDA styling must remain advisory (indigo/violet, not primary green authority)
- Page states must use `src/lib/ui/pageStateModel.ts` + `src/components/ui/state/` (RC-004)
- Empty copy must use `src/lib/ui/emptyStateContent.ts` on pilot surfaces (RC-005)
- Interaction feedback must use `useGovernanceFeedback` + `GovernanceFeedbackHost` on pilot surfaces (RC-006)
- Conservative actions use per-action loading flags; no double submit
- Archive requires `DestructiveConfirmDialog` + `ARCHIVE_CONFIRM` (not `window.confirm` on pilot)
- Hover/focus on tabs, cards, links uses `src/lib/ui/interactionClasses.ts`
- Tabs use full WAI-ARIA pattern in `GovernanceMatterDetailTabs` (RC-007)
- Forms require visible labels; queue buttons use `governanceA11y.ts` contextual names
- Loading uses layout skeletons on pilot pages; spinners only for inline actions
- Motion uses canonical tokens from `src/lib/ui/motionClasses.ts` (RC-008)
- Do not scatter arbitrary `duration-150` / `duration-300` on pilot surfaces — use `duration-motion-*`
- Reduced motion: `motion-reduce:transition-none` / `motion-reduce:animate-none` on animated pilot classes
- No route-wide transitions, animation libraries, spring/bounce, or decorative entrance on empty/error states
- RC-009 release gate: meeting save must link `community_resolution_id` / `meeting_id` to matter; voting handoff must set `voting_id` — see RC-009 P1 issues before RC-010

## Lifecycle colors

- Single source: `governanceLifecyclePresentation.ts` + `tailwind.config.js` lifecycle tokens
- Do not scatter hard-coded stage colors in pilot components
